    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>Kabuto possess thick, lacquer-like plates and a prominent horn or reinforced brow. Their bodies resemble walking armour, and their deliberate movements are accompanied by the scrape of overlapping chitin. Kabuto traditionally serve as vanguard soldiers, royal guards, builders and stonemasons.</p>\n<p>Kabuto doctrine teaches that strength is valuable only when it bears weight for others.</p>\n<p>You increase base natural DR by 1 but reduce speed by 5. Furthermore, you may increase your weight allowance by 50.</p>\n<p><em>Applied automatically:</em> Base DR +1 (3 with Chitinous Carapace; audit IT-m5 reads \"base natural DR\" and \"Base DR\" as one statistic), land Speed −5 feet, and +50 lb to your weight allowance (5 points of carrying Strength, beside Hauler and a Backpack).</p>",
